---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | The English Hacker"
  description="Privacy policy for TheEnglishHacker.com"
>
  <header class="border-b border-hacker-border px-6 py-4">
    <a href="/" class="text-hacker-green font-bold text-sm">&gt;_ TheEnglishHacker</a>
  </header>

  <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-hacker-dim">
    <div>
      <div class="text-xs text-hacker-dim mb-2">// LEGAL</div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-hacker-text">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs mt-2">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</p>
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-hacker-text font-bold">1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>TheEnglishHacker.com is an independent Cambridge exam practice platform operated as a personal project. Contact: <a href="mailto:hello@theenglishhacker.com" class="text-hacker-green hover:underline">hello@theenglishhacker.com</a></p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-hacker-text font-bold">2. Data we collect</h2>
      <p><strong class="text-hacker-text">In your browser (localStorage):</strong> Your exercise progress, scores, and access tokens. This data never leaves your device and is not sent to our servers.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-hacker-text">If you join a waitlist:</strong> Your email address and the level you're interested in, submitted via Formspree (a third-party form service). See <a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy" class="text-hacker-green hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Formspree's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-hacker-text">If you make a purchase:</strong> Payment is processed entirely by Stripe. We do not store your card details. See <a href="https://stripe.com/privacy" class="text-hacker-green hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Stripe's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-hacker-text font-bold">3. Cookies</h2>
      <p>This site does not use tracking cookies or advertising cookies. We do not use Google Analytics or Facebook Pixel. Your browser's localStorage is used for functionality only (saving your progress).</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-hacker-text font-bold">4. Your rights</h2>
      <p>Under GDPR, you have the right to access, rectify, or delete any personal data we hold. To exercise these rights, contact us at the email above. Your localStorage data can be cleared at any time via your browser settings.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-hacker-text font-bold">5. Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page indicates when it was last revised.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
